{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/49893-seeking-any-help-making-riven-from-lol-into-a-dawn-caste-solar","id":49893,"title":"Seeking any help making Riven from LoL into a Dawn Caste Solar","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-15T10:25:05-08:00","id":49893,"title":"Seeking any help making Riven from LoL into a Dawn Caste Solar","content":"Can someone help me create Riven from League of Legends as a Dawn Caste Solar using EdExalted's Solar Toolkit? I really can't afford to buy any of the sourcebooks at the moment, though I do plan on it and really get into the game, and this idea has been just driving me up a wall for over a year, and I just want to finally get it out and done with so it will stop bugging me. Finding out about Ed's Toolkit at least helps me a little since it does give descriptions on what most charms and abilities actually do, but I do need help. If anyone is willing to help, thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2011-barret","name":"Barret","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T15:03:35-08:00","id":50120,"title":"","content":"Riven! Good choice for an Exalted, even though she feels more Infernal than Solar to me ^^. (Compared to, say, Lux or Leona). Still, she's a good fit for a Dawn. Here's what I have so far (right out of chargen, with the 2.5 errata)<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>NAME : Riven<br /> CONCEPT : the Exile</b><br /> <br /> <b>Caste :</b> Dawn<br /> <b>Motivation :</b> Find atonement<br /> <b>Intimacies :</b> The League (respect), Her home country (bitter resentment), Her broken blade (nostalgic holdout), Darwinian meritocracy (deep belief)<br /> <br /> <b>ATTRIBUTES</b><br /> Strength 4, Dexterity 5, Stamina 2<br /> Charisma 2, Manipulation 1, Appearance 4<br /> Perception 2, Intelligence 2, Wits 5<br /> <br /> <b>ABILITIES</b><br /> <i>Martial Arts</i> 2, <i>Melee </i>5, <i>War</i> 3<br /> Integrity 3, Presence 2, Resistance 2<br /> <i>Investigation</i> 2<br /> <i>Athletics</i> 3, <i>Awareness</i> 3, <i>Dodge</i> 4<br /> <i>Linguistics</i> 1, Ride 1, Socialize 1<br /> <br /> <b>VIRTUES</b><br /> Compassion 1<br /> Conviction 5 (Flaw : Reckless Overconfidence*)<br /> Temperance 1<br /> Valor 3<br /> <br /> <b>Willpower :</b> 8<br /> <br /> <b>Essence :</b> 2 (Personal 14/ Peripheral 39)<br /> <br /> <b>BACKGROUNDS</b><br /> Artifact 1<br /> Backing 3<br /> Resources 3<br /> <br /> <b>CHARMS</b><br /> First Melee Excellency<br /> One Weapon, Two Blows<br /> Peony Blossom Attack<br /> Iron Whirlwind Attack<br /> Call the Blade<br /> Glorious Solar Saber<br /> Iron Raptor technique<br /> Blazing Solar Bolt<br /> Dipping swallow Defense<br /> Bulkwark Stance<br /> First Athletics Excellency<br /> Thunderbolt Attack Prana</div></div> </div> </div><br /> Her <i>favored abilities</i> (and her <i>cast abilities</i>) are in italics.<br /> Her Artifact rating is supposed to represent her broken sword, which has the stats of a Short black jade Daiklave. Her Backing and Resources come from the League (in Creation, maybe she has allied herself with the Guild or a similarly powerful organisation)<br /> *Her Limit Break is Reckless Overconfidence. When in the throes of limit break, she severs all links to characters and organisation she was allied to before in order to pursue her goals utterly alone for at least a week, believing that she has a better chance of succeding without &quot;dead weight&quot; holding her back. Under partial control, she can maintain links to persons and organisation she has positive intimacies towards. Her limit break condiction is witnessing characters who claim to uphold a specific code of honor acting in defiance of it.<br /> <br /> <b>Broken Wings :</b> A series of powerful slashes, Broken Wings is the name of the combo containing <i>One Weapon, Two Blows</i> and <i>Iron Whirlwind Attack</i>.<br /> <b>Ki Burst :</b> Is a combo that deals physical damage to all enemies within range, a combination of<i> Peony Blossom Attack</i> and <i>Iron Whirlwind Attack</i>.<br /> <b>Valor :</b> Is a signature combo signaled when she dashes towards her ennemy, activating <i>Thunderbolt Attack Prana</i> and <i>Bulkward Stance</i> to help her defend herself.<br /> <b>Blade of the Exile :</b> When she uses <i>Glorious Solar Saber</i>, Riven's sword is reformed, gaining the stats of a three dot Orichalcum Grand Daiklave for only 3 motes and 1 wp (since she already starts out with a one dot artefact.)<br /> <b>Wind Slash :</b> Is a combo of <i>Blazing Solar Bolt</i> and <i>One Weapon, Two Blows</i>, allowing her to make a powerful attack at a distance with her sword.<br /> Of course, her <i>First Melee Excellency</i> is a good addition to any of her combos, as well as a good way to represent her passive.<br /> <br /> I didn't give her any specialties for her Abilities (she should have 4 to distribute), didn't get to calculating her DVs, and I didn't double-check everything properly, but she should be a good fit. For a chargen Dawn, she has good offense and pretty low defense, so I'd advise you to give her at least a bit of armor in case she encounters something she isn't able to curbstomp at will.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":541,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","user":"LeTipex","date":". 01-15-2014, 06:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T16:46:45-08:00","id":50234,"title":"","content":"No, no, no. The challenge is Cho'Gath.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sure, there's no way to canonically do it, but Exalted allows you to knee canon in the crotch and rifle through its pockets to take what you need while it whimpers on the ground. - mockery","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/374-nocte-ex-mortis","name":"Nocte ex Mortis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar374_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T17:12:45-08:00","id":50255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nocte ex Mortis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/49893-seeking-any-help-making-riven-from-lol-into-a-dawn-caste-solar?p=50234#post50234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, no, no. The challenge is Cho'Gath.</div> </div> </div> </div>As a Solar? Outch.<br /> <br /> As an Infernal or Lunar, it's... possible to maybe get somewhat close, if you're allowed to homebrew a few charms.<br /> <br /> As a behemoth or something of the sort, it would be easiest (and kinda awesome), but hard to play as a PC.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.th