gba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>NAME : Riven<br /> CONCEPT : the Exile</b><br /> <br /> <b>Caste :</b> Dawn<br /> <b>Motivation :</b> Find atonement<br /> <b>Intimacies :</b> The League (respect), Her home country (bitter resentment), Her broken blade (nostalgic holdout), Darwinian meritocracy (deep belief)<br /> <br /> <b>ATTRIBUTES</b><br /> Strength 4, Dexterity 5, Stamina 2<br /> Charisma 2, Manipulation 1, Appearance 4<br /> Perception 2, Intelligence 2, Wits 5<br /> <br /> <b>ABILITIES</b><br /> <i>Martial Arts</i> 2, <i>Melee </i>5, <i>War</i> 3<br /> Integrity 3, Presence 2, Resistance 2<br /> <i>Investigation</i> 2<br /> <i>Athletics</i> 3, <i>Awareness</i> 3, <i>Dodge</i> 4<br /> <i>Linguistics</i> 1, Ride 1, Socialize 1<br /> <br /> <b>VIRTUES</b><br /> Compassion 1<br /> Conviction 5 (Flaw : Reckless Overconfidence*)<br /> Temperance 1<br /> Valor 3<br /> <br /> <b>Willpower :</b> 8<br /> <br /> <b>Essence :</b> 2 (Personal 14/ Peripheral 39)<br /> <br /> <b>BACKGROUNDS</b><br /> Artifact 1<br /> Backing 3<br /> Resources 3<br /> <br /> <b>CHARMS</b><br /> First Melee Excellency<br /> One Weapon, Two Blows<br /> Peony Blossom Attack<br /> Iron Whirlwind Attack<br /> Call the Blade<br /> Glorious Solar Saber<br /> Iron Raptor technique<br /> Blazing Solar Bolt<br /> Dipping swallow Defense<br /> Bulkwark Stance<br /> First Athletics Excellency<br /> Thunderbolt Attack Prana</div></div> </div> </div><br /> Her <i>favored abilities</i> (and her <i>cast abilities</i>) are in italics.<br /> Her Artifact rating is supposed to represent her broken sword, which has the stats of a Short black jade Daiklave. Her Backing and Resources come from the League (in Creation, maybe she has allied herself with the Guild or a similarly powerful organisation)<br /> *Her Limit Break is Reckless Overconfidence. When in the throes of limit break, she severs all links to characters and organisation she was allied to before in order to pursue her goals utterly alone for at least a week, believing that she has a better chance of succeding without &quot;dead weight&quot; holding her back. Under partial control, she can maintain links to persons and organisation she has positive intimacies towards. Her limit break condiction is witnessing characters who claim to uphold a specific code of honor acting in defiance of it.<br /> <br /> <b>Broken Wings :</b> A series of powerful slashes, Broken Wings is the name of the combo containing <i>One Weapon, Two Blows</i> and <i>Iron Whirlwind Attack</i>.<br /> <b>Ki Burst :</b> Is a combo that deals physical damage to all enemies within range, a combination of<i> Peony Blossom Attack</i> and <i>Iron Whirlwind Attack</i>.<br /> <b>Valor :</b> Is a signature combo signaled when she dashes towards her ennemy, activating <i>Thunderbolt Attack Prana</i> and <i>Bulkward Stance</i> to help her defend herself.<br /> <b>Blade of the Exile :</b> When she uses <i>Glorious Solar Saber</i>, Riven's sword is reformed, gaining the stats of a three dot Orichalcum Grand Daiklave for only 3 motes and 1 wp (since she already starts out with a one dot artefact.)<br /> <b>Wind Slash :</b> Is a combo of <i>Blazing Solar Bolt</i> and <i>One Weapon, Two Blows</i>, allowing her to make a powerful attack at a distance with her sword.<br /> Of course, her <i>First Melee Excellency</i> is a good addition to any of her combos, as well as a good way to represent her passive.<br /> <br /> I didn't give her any specialties for her Abilities (she should have 4 to distribute), didn't get to calculating her DVs, and I didn't double-check everything properly, but she should be a good fit. For a chargen Dawn, she has good offense and pretty low defense, so I'd advise you to give her at least a bit of armor in case she encounters something she isn't able to curbstomp at will.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2011-barret","user":"Barret","date":". 01-15-2014, 11:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2011-barret","name":"Barret","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T21:06:33-08:00","id":50403,"title":"","content":"Should I know what &quot;League of Legends&quot; is? Or the &quot;Solar Tookit&quot;, for that matter? I feel like I should...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T22:02:10-08:00","id":50434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/49893-seeking-any-help-making-riven-from-lol-into-a-dawn-caste-solar?p=50403#post50403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Should I know what &quot;League of Legends&quot; is? Or the &quot;Solar Tookit&quot;, for that matter? I feel like I should...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>League of Legends is an online MOBA game. EdExalted's Toolkits are a series of programs to help you create characters for Exalted. The Solar toolkit is the one that is for Solars. I also have the Anathema Program that does the same thing. It unfortunately only has charm descriptions while EdExalted's have descriptions for most of everything else. Since I don't have the sourcebooks at the moment, the descriptions of what thing are and do helps a lot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2011-barret","name":"Barret","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T07:13:54-08:00","id":50655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/49893-seeking-any-help-making-riven-from-lol-into-a-dawn-caste-solar?p=50403#post50403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Should I know what &quot;League of Legends&quot; is? Or the &quot;Solar Tookit&quot;, for that matter? I feel like I should...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Basically, LoL is a computer game that pits two teams of 5 &quot;Champions&quot; in a battle to seize the other team's Nexus (picture a base that spaws minions at will). It's horribly popular right now (to the point of having professionnal player that -gasp- aren't all coreans). A bit more played in the EU than the US, if I remember well.<br /> <br /> And some of the Champions are impressive fits for Exalted characters. (There are a bit more than a hundred so far, and you can probably find some that fit any splat you choose to pic).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T07:29:11-08:00","id":50660,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/49893-seeking-any-help-making-riven-from-lol-into-a-dawn-caste-solar?p=50655#post50655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Basically, LoL is a computer game that pits two teams of 5 &quot;Champions&quot; in a battle to seize the other team's Nexus (picture a base that spaws minions at will). It's horribly popular right now (to the point of having professionnal player that -gasp- aren't all coreans). A bit more played in the EU than the US, if I remember well.<br /> <br /> And some of the Champions are impressive fits for Exalted characters. (There are a bit more than a hundred so far, and you can probably find some that fit any splat you choose to pic).</div> </div> </div> </div>I play Dota, which is a very similar game. <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">And obviously much better.</span><br /> I kinda want to see Lich as an Abyssal under Mask of Winters, makes me wonder if Mask enjoys ice-related puns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I made some Martial Arts for 3e, look at them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723442-survival-is-fury-the-monster-reborn-ex3\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/761356-orgiastic-fugitive-style-3e\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/632-while-my-guitar","name":"While My Guitar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar632_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T08:33:17-08:00","id":50707,"title":"","content":"I play a little LoL too, and besides Leona, Varus' Archlight skin is the most Solar-y thing I've ever seen. I bought Varus just for that skin.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=224\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signat